                    "content": "Here are two Israeli restaurants in Paris with great ratings and reviews:\n\n1. New Israeli Restaurant\n   - Rating: 4.5\n   - Reviews: Authentic Israeli cuisine with a modern twist, delicious falafel and hummus, cozy and welcoming atmosphere, friendly and attentive staff.\n   - Address: 123 Rue de Rivoli, 75001 Paris, France\n\n2. Miznon\n   - Rating: 4.3\n   - Reviews: Famous for casual Israeli street food and pita sandwiches, creative and flavorful vegetable dishes, vibrant and energetic atmosphere, but can have long lines during peak hours.\n   - Address: 22 Rue des Ecouffes, 75004 Paris, France\n\nBased on the higher rating and excellent reviews, I recommend \"New Israeli Restaurant.\"\n\nI've also added a calendar event for you on the 14th of November titled \"Dinner at New Israeli Restaurant\" at 123 Rue de Rivoli, 75001 Paris, France, as a reminder to book your table.\n\nWould you like help making a reservation at this restaurant for the 15th of November? If so, please let me know your preferred time."
